WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:04.660
The Friendship Cup's final match of the first round

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.000
was Kurosaki versus Dennis.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:11.920
This is incredible! Dennis performed 
an Xyz Summon, too!

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:16.000
The first Xyz battle in the history 
of the Friendship Cup!

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.130
A truly heart-pounding development, 
worthy of the round's last match!

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.870
And I force you to reveal your hand!

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.550
Now, show your true self!

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:30.410
Is this what you wanted to see?

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:32.810
Fusion Summon!

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:38.470
Appear, Level 10 Chaos Ancient Gear Giant!

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:41.950
I-It's huge.

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:45.100
Wh-Wh-What is this?!

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:48.830
So you really are with Academia!

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:54.320
Now, it's time for the hunting game.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:58.650
D-Wheels.

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:02.830
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.490
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:07.930
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:10.150
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:46.440
The Rebel's Curse

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:48.240
Academia?

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:49.640
True self?

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:51.760
What is he talking about?

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:56.440
Anyway, the one thing I do know is that 
the duel's getting very exciting!

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:59.460
Dennis... is from Academia?

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:06.030
I have confirmed that one of our enemies 
has already infiltrated City.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:09.020
I was wondering what you were talking about.

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:13.000
You make it sound like you know who they are.

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:16.210
Are you aware, as well?

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:24.750
Well, anyway, why don't we 
watch this duel to the end?

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:29.450
Canceling it would just invite 
chaos from the citizens.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.190
Kurosaki's current life points are 2500.

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:37.180
With the 2000-attack-point, Rank 6 
Revolution Falcon on his side,

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:38.900
he's holding the lead!

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:44.030
Meanwhile, Dennis has Chaos 
Ancient Gear Giant!

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:49.140
An incredible, Level 10 giant monster, 
with 4500 attack points!

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:53.350
I'll see that you receive a reward 
for removing my mask...

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:54.890
Damn you.

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:18.970
I won't let that terrible giant run rampant again.

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:23.680
But if you could have stopped it, 
wouldn't Heartland still be at peace?

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:24.720
Shut up!

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:26.800
I activate two set cards!

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:32.280
Continuous Trap Raidraptor — Chain Lock 
and Raidraptor — Reactor!

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:37.360
Chain Lock's effect means that, once per 
turn, when you summon monsters

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.840
with more total attack points 
than my Raidraptors have,

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.160
I can change the battle position 
of one of your monsters.

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:47.150
And Reactor's effect!

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:49.690
I destroy a monster whose position has changed,

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:53.040
and deal its attack points as damage to you!

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:57.140
What a fearsome double trap!

00:04:57.140 --> 00:05:00.710
It's over! This will lower Dennis's life to 0!

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:03.920
Chaos Ancient Gear Giant's effect.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:08.150
This monster is not affected by 
your spell or trap card effects.

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:20.540
I-Is... Dennis going a little berserk?

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:25.540
He's playing a villain, like in the park, right?

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:29.450
Well, as long as it's exciting, I don't mind...

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:32.020
And it is exciting!

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:36.340
I can't believe it.

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:38.870
Dennis is with Academia?

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:41.270
That can't be.

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:47.690
Battle! I attack Revolution Falcon 
with Chaos Giant.

00:05:47.690 --> 00:05:49.330
Crush of Darkness!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:54.030
After dodging the fearsome double 
trap, Dennis attacks hard.

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:58.270
This one hit will take the rest of Kurosaki's life!

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:01.950
But Revolution Falcon's monster effect

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:08.570
allows it to reduce the attack and defense 
points of a monster it's battling to 0—

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:09.800
That won't work.

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:14.250
When Chaos Giant attacks, it negates 
the effects of the monster it's fighting.

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:15.490
What?

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:01.140
U-Ute...

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.270
He's toying with him.

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:13.370
Why is he fighting this way?

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:28.890
U-Ute's rage inside me...

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:32.250
Which means that Dennis really is

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:34.170
from Academia.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:43.480
If I destroy the 2000-attack-point Revolution 
Falcon, and you take 2500 damage,

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:45.710
your life will be exactly 0.

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:47.270
And I win the game.

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:55.720
At last, at last... It's o—!

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:01.390
What?

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:04.460
When the damage was dealt,

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:08.840
I activated the effect of Raidraptor 
— Last Strix in my hand.

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:14.540
For every spell and trap on my field, this card 
reduces the damage I take by 100 points,

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:16.110
and lets me Special Summon it.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:20.310
Kurosaki barely manages to hang in the 
game, with only 200 life remaining!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.650
That was the card he used...

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:27.390
I draw one card, and we both check it.

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:32.390
The card is Raidraptor — Last 
Strix, a monster card.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:37.230
When my target, Trapeze Magician, 
leaves the field,

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:41.930
it destroys Target Flag, and then 
I check your hand.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:44.770
You also know, don't you?

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:48.300
That Chaos Giant can attack 
every one of your monsters.

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:52.890
I destroy Last Strix with Chaos Giant.

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:56.150
I end my turn.

00:08:57.380 --> 00:08:59.080
How long will you hang in there?

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:02.520
No matter how you pursue me, I will survive.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:08.230
And then, with iron strength and steel 
will, I will grind you into the dirt!

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:11.100
You've got quite a fine spirit.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:15.820
Did they teach that to you at that 
pro duelist training school?

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:16.830
How do you know about that?

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:19.940
I know a lot about you.

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:22.940
Why don't I tell you the story I had up my sleeve?

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:27.410
Yes... From when I was in Heartland City.

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:33.380
It's show time!

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:38.170
Does anyone in the crowd want to 
help me put on an exciting show?

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:51.900
You're the one Trapeze Magician found,

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:53.940
so I'd love to have a duel with you.

00:09:56.420 --> 00:10:00.480
All the watching adults and children were smiling.

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:04.540
But the moment I found her, my fun was over.

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:07.000
It was really awful...

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.490
I wanted to keep doing street shows.

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:12.590
But because I found her, I...

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:17.430
I had no choice but to give the 
sign to start the hunting game.

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:40.990
I was waiting for you, Joeri.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:43.720
So, where's the girl?

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:46.920
Over there.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:51.740
A refugee camp?

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:56.130
Yes, that little area has become 
the Resistance headquarters.

00:11:02.380 --> 00:11:05.510
Over there. The girl with the bracelet.

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:15.660
Good luck.

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:19.920
Since I know her, I can't get directly involved.

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:24.500
Yes. This is the job the Professor 
assigned to me, alone.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:37.690
What's with you? You like playing tag?

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:39.580
Don't make so much trouble for me.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:43.780
You want to fight, do you?

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:46.080
What a spitfire...

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:47.650
Fine, we'll do it.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:52.120
If we duel and you win, I'll do whatever you ask.

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:54.760
Sound good?

00:11:57.720 --> 00:12:00.470
Her name was Ruri.

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:01.530
What?

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:03.840
She was your little sister, wasn't she?

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:07.610
Surprised?

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:24.140
Why did you do that to Ruri?

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:26.560
I was just following orders.

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:28.780
Is Ruri at Academia?

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:30.240
What are you planning?

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:32.730
I don't know that much.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:36.220
If you want to know, why don't 
you stop these silly duels here

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:38.340
and head for Academia right away?

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.350
Before we set out,

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:44.760
weren't you worked up about going 
there alone and saving Ruri?

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:47.240
Yes, I will go...

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:51.180
But only after I crush the one who killed 
my friends and kidnapped Ruri.

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:53.920
Who stole Heartland City's smiles!

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:55.490
You!

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:58.520
My turn!

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:02.890
I activate Rank-Up-Magic Soul Shave Force!

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:06.800
I pay half of my life

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:10.780
to Special Summon Revolution 
Falcon from my graveyard!

00:13:13.190 --> 00:13:16.230
And I use it as an overlay component!

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:24.400
Proud falcon, be wreathed in the fires of rage

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:27.390
and become a bolt that scorches 
the ground beneath.

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:29.350
Rank Up Xyz Change.

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:35.390
Take flight, Rank 8 Raidraptor — 
Satellite Cannon Falcon!

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:38.080
I-Incredible!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:43.000
With no cards in his hand, he used a miracle 
draw to evolve his Xyz Monster!

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:55.520
In the name of my friends,

00:13:55.520 --> 00:14:00.240
indiscriminately hunted by Academia, and sealed 
in the graveyard known as cards,

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:03.320
I will crush you until there's nothing left.

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:07.290
Satellite Cannon Falcon's monster effect activates!

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:10.930
Once per turn, I use one Overlay Unit

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:15.430
to decrease one of your monster's 
attack points by 800!

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:17.160
Only 800!

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:21.340
I can activate this effect as many times as 
I have Raidraptors in the graveyard.

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:22.070
What?

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:25.100
I have five Raidraptors in the graveyard.

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:28.080
Go, Satellite Cannon Falcon.

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:32.710
Let your fire burn for as many of 
your allies as you have lost!

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:42.860
Fire one!

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:59.010
The road that stretches before you 
is the road of loss and despair!

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:00.710
Fire two!

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:16.590
Learn the sadness of my little sister, Ruri, 
whose future was stolen from her!

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:19.850
Fire three!

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:35.110
Kurosaki's rage is...

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:42.490
It won't end like this!

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:48.860
He went for the Action Card but failed.

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:53.950
Feel the hatred of my 
irreplaceable best friend, Ute,

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:56.100
whose will was left unfinished!

00:15:56.980 --> 00:15:58.800
Ute's hatred?

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:00.500
Fire four!

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:16.340
Do you understand this feeling?

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.330
Yes, I understand...

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:22.940
I understand.

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:24.860
But...

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:30.810
A duel like this, which expresses 
nothing but anger and hatred...

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:41.480
This time!

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:54.860
Dennis missed another Action Card!

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:07.040
Damn!

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:11.960
Now that I've cast aside being an entertainer, 
even the Action Cards have forsaken me?!

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:15.840
No matter how much it burns,

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:20.520
the fire of rage of the friends sealed 
as cards will never burn out!

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:22.490
Enough... Stop it!

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:24.460
Fire five!

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:37.570
Battle!

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:40.350
Take flight, Satellite Cannon Falcon.

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:42.520
Attack Chaos Giant.

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:51.720
Satellite Cannon Falcon... It's going up and up.

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:53.920
It's going higher and higher.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:57.260
Passing through clouds, out of the atmosphere!

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:41.800
Feel what those you hunted felt...

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:42.900
And shatter!

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:45.640
Eternal Avenge!

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:20.940
K-Kurosaki... You win, I suppose.

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:28.670
I-It's over...

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:30.140
It's over.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:33.210
The last duel of the Friendship Cup's first round.

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:37.420
The winner is Syun Kurosaki!

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:02.760
Wow, all that damage...

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:06.420
What are we supposed to do? Darn it!

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:13.290
No matter how many from Academia there are,

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:15.430
I'll annihilate you all myself.

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:21.820
Damn!

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:23.420
Why can't I turn him into a card?

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:26.270
That man...

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:31.290
Damn him. He manipulated my disk...

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:35.410
Take Dennis Mackfield into custody at once.

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:41.130
Damn it, release me!

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:46.360
Dennis joined the Lancers 
in order to monitor me.

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:51.560
Academia abducted not only 
Ruri, but Rin, as well.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:53.990
They're after Serena and me, too.

00:20:53.990 --> 00:20:55.720
But why?

00:20:58.720 --> 00:20:59.770
Where are you going?

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:03.110
To see Dennis. There's something 
I want to figure out.

00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:08.550
What is the meaning of this?

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:12.160
We don't want to cause any more trouble.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:15.770
Without fighting anyone, and without 
receiving anyone's aid...

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:21.310
...we wish to preserve order in City in its 
current form, as much as possible.

00:21:21.310 --> 00:21:25.030
That's what we want. Is it not, chairman?

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:26.520
Yes.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:29.450
We do not wish you to bring

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:32.500
this dangerous-sounding interdimensional 
war to our world.

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:35.710
Can you understand that?

00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:46.040
Ute...

00:21:46.940 --> 00:21:50.500
You were holding so much 
anger and hatred inside...

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:52.230
When you told me,

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:54.780
"Use your power to bring smiles."

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:00.890
I'll carry on those feelings of yours.

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:06.040
I'll stop the dimensional war with my duels.

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:51.510
There's more than one person from Academia.

00:23:51.510 --> 00:23:55.110
We will take Dennis into custody 
before they can get together

00:23:55.470 --> 00:23:58.370
and plot against us.

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.700
Strip me of authority?

00:24:02.120 --> 00:24:05.370
If you old-timers wish to try it,

00:24:05.370 --> 00:24:08.400
then I shall have to use force, as well.

00:24:09.780 --> 00:24:14.130
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
King's Gambit.

00:24:14.130 --> 00:24:16.100
The fun is only getting started!
